From 3e2176d45724ce0b902d99deac819b1741f21056 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: apply <apply@localhost>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:17:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] 0025-run-pack-names-roots

[Delta 0025] run_study.py / run_pack.py: BNJ_DATA_ROOT, BNJ_RUN_ROOT and BNJ_CAMPAIGN_DIR
from the environment (defaults = the 2026-09-22 screen paths, as in the anchor bundle);
pack entries may be run names; a dict-form packs file carries run_root / data_root
(pack_meta data_root wins) exported to the children; unknown names, a missing run_root
and conflicting environment values are refused (exit 2) before any arm starts. A legacy
list of row-number lists with no BNJ_* variable is unchanged. Test: tests/test_run_pack_delta.py.
---
